<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Tuesday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	   6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	 9.65 / 9.55   10.10 /10.00    10.55 /10.45</p>
<p>BPI			 9.65 / 9.55   10.125/10.05    10.65 /10.55</p>
<p>Citibank		  9.65 / 9.50   10.125/ 9.90    10.65 /10.40</p>
<p>Multinational	   9.70 / 9.60   10.10 /10.05    10.445/10.35</p>
<p>PNB			 9.65 / 9.525  10.10 /10.00    10.60 /10.50</p>
<p>StandChart Bank	 9.75 / 9.65   10.15 /10.05</p>
<p>10.625/10.525</p>
<p>* To contribute to this page, please fax your quotes to Reuters Manila newsroom on (632) 817 6267. For details, please phone (632) 841 8937</p>
